    <!-- Auto-launch badge. The glyph is dark ON PURPOSE and has no values-night twin: the amber
         is fixed in both themes, so a theme-varying text token would break one of them. White on
         this amber measured 1.63:1 — the same text-colour-versus-container mismatch as AUD-146 and
         AUD-148, on the one badge a user sees in the ordinary app list. This pairing is 10.56:1.
         The sibling shortcut badge is left alone: white on its #1565C0 blue is 5.65:1. -->
    <color name="auto_launch_badge_fill">#FFC107</color>
    <color name="auto_launch_badge_on">#1A1B1F</color>

